title: Coalition Negot
view-if: your_mother == "President of America"
on-arrival: {!

 Q.coalition_r = Q.spd_r;
Q.spd_leverage = Q.spd_r;
Q.z_leverage = 0;
Q.dvp_leverage = 0;
Q.total_bourgeois_leverage = 0;

Q.ddp_coal_points = Q.ddp_relation;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.ddp_coal_points += 15;
if (Q.bourgeois_coalition_r < 50) Q.ddp_coal_points += 20;

Q.z_coal_points = Q.z_relation;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.z_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.bourgeois_coalition_r < 50) Q.z_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.right_coalition_r < 50) Q.z_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.spd_votes < 20) Q.z_coal_points += 15;

Q.dvp_coal_points = Q.dvp_relation;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.dvp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.bourgeois_coalition_r < 50) Q.dvp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.right_coalition_r < 50) Q.dvp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.spd_votes < 20) Q.dvp_coal_points += 15;

Q.dhp_coal_points = 0;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.dhp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.bourgeois_coalition_r < 50) Q.dhp_coal_points += 5;
if (Q.right_coalition_r < 50) Q.dhp_coal_points += 5;

Q.dbp_coal_points = 0;
if (Q.bavaria_gov == "Social-Agrarian") Q.dbp_points += 60;
if (Q.bavaria_dbp == 1 && Q.bavaria_spd == 1) Q.dbp_points += 30;

Q.wp_coal_points = Q.dvp_relation / 2;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.wp_coal_points += 5;
if (Q.bourgeois_coalition_r < 50) Q.wp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.right_coalition_r < 50) Q.wp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.spd_votes < 10) Q.wp_coal_points += 20;             
             
             
!}

Whether a party decides to enter the coalition or not depends on your relations, ideology, other options and which parties are invited as well.


- @return_to_coalopt: Negotiate a coalition agreement
  
  @return_to_coalopt
on-arrival: {!
  Q.total_bourgeois_leverage = Q.z_leverage + Q.dvp_leverage;
if (Q.national_z = 1) Q.dhp_coal_points += 30;
if (Q.national_bvp = 1) Q.dhp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.national_ddp = 1) Q.dhp_coal_points += 10;

if (Q.national_z = 1) Q.dbp_coal_points += 20;
if (Q.national_bvp = 1) Q.dbp_coal_points += 50;

if (Q.national_ddp = 1) Q.z_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.national_z = 1) Q.ddp_coal_points += 10;
if (Q.national_ddp = 1) Q.dvp_coal_points += 15;
if (Q.national_z = 1) Q.dvp_coal_points += 15;

if (Q.national_dvp = 1) Q.wp_coal_points += 15;

             
             !}

Current support: [+ coalition_r +]%

